{"abstract":[{"text":"Bullet list is a UI element that helps to view in related individual text items grouped together; items usually starting with a number or a bullet.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bullet list is also known as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unordered list","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ordered list","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and is not an interactive element by default.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBulletList"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBulletList"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSBulletList","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSBulletListV","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSBulletList","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/ContentDisplay"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Types","text":"Types","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Three types are proposed:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered (by default)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items that don’t need to be in a specific order or sequence."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items with numeric order or sequence."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bare"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": An unordered list without any bullets or alphanumeric sequence."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Types can be mixed in list, but must be identical for the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSBulletList.NestedLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Levels","text":"Levels","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lists can include nested items to indicate hierarchy or subcategories, with indentation distinguishing each level.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Arrange ordered list items logically, such as ranking by importance, highest to lowest values, or in alphabetical \/ numeric order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Three levels are maximum.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Text-Style","text":"Text Style","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"List can be used with different font sizes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Large"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Large text. This variant is designed for more visual, engaging experiences."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Medium text. This variant is best suited for functional, task-oriented experiences."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","text":"Cases forbidden by design","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it is not allowed to have a depth of items greater than 3"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Internationalisation-considerations","text":"Internationalisation considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For latin-based speaking countries, like France, Spain, United Kingdom or Belgium, the european “arabic” numbers are used for the first level of depth","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the ordered bullet list. For the second and third levels, the european alphabets are used with upper and lower case values.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"However for countries speaking arabic, these rules can’t be applied. Indeed, there is no notion of upper and lower case characters in arabic alphabet.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition, the numbers in use (i.e. the european “arabic” numbers like “1, 2, 3”) are accepted in arabic countries, even if the “true arabic” numbers (like “ ٢ ٣ ١”) are used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in middle-east arabic countries and for official documents.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus the OUDS ordered bullet list will use “european” numbers for first level, and arabic alphabets for second and third levels.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["       \/\/ 1. Unordered list with bullets","       OUDSBulletList {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 1.1. Item of Unordered list with bullet as tick, a text style","       \/\/ body medium and text bold","       OUDSBulletList(type: .unordered(asset: .tick),","                      textStyle: .bodyMedium,","                      isBold: true)  {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 2. Bare list with 3 items","       OUDSBulletList(type: .bare) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3. Ordered list with 3 items","       OUDSBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3.1. Ordered list with 3 items in first level,","       \/\/ and one item as sub item (second level),","       \/\/ and 2 items as sub item in (third level)","       OUDSBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\") {","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ Same Bullet list but items in third level with free icon as bullet","       let icon = Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")","       OUDSBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\", subListType: .unordered(asset: .icon(icon))) {","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           OUDSBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Rich-text-recommendations","text":"Rich text recommendations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Rich text can be applied for bullet list whatever the ","type":"text"},{"code":"isBold","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flag is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly within alert messages to highlight key information.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be used for emphasis, as it is commonly associated with links.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined links must be bold.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If a hyperlink is needed within the content, the underlined style should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Italic should be used with care, some brands do not allow it like Orange brand.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-bullet-list","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_bullet_list_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_bullet_list_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_bullet_list_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_bullet_list_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.1.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Version","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/Item"]},{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/body"]},{"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/TextStyle","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/Type","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBulletList\/Unordered